/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 190 0 R
/E (        HighWater is a robot created to complete a fruit-harvesting simulation involving autonomous navigation and harvesting of 3d-printed fruit props located on PVC trees. One of the main goals of the project was to familiarize students with good goal setting habits, and as such groups were allowed to decide what the capabilities of their final robot would be, with grades being based on how well the final design met the proposed set of end goals.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
